810
00:41:47,364 --> 00:41:49,064
カブトムシが見えるのじゃ！
I can see the beetle...!

811
00:41:49,064 --> 00:41:52,564
Hi, Mela! Come up here, put the rope from up here. Come here!

812
00:41:52,564 --> 00:41:54,864
I set... Ah, the rope is short!

813
00:41:54,864 --> 00:41:57,064
のじゃー！ カブトムシ怖いのじゃ！
...! Beetles are scary...!

814
00:41:57,064 --> 00:42:01,064
Okay, fine. I will distract! Run! Waaah!

815
00:42:01,064 --> 00:42:03,564
Thank you! よいしょ！
Thank you! Heave-ho!

816
00:42:06,564 --> 00:42:11,564
Biboo-senpai! Biboo-senpai, what are you doing? Biboo-senpai, what are you doing?

817
00:42:11,564 --> 00:42:13,564
I am distracting the bug!

818
00:42:13,564 --> 00:42:15,564
Oh my god!

819
00:42:15,564 --> 00:42:19,564
風やばい！ 風やばい！ 風やばい！ ウインド... ウインドやばいのじゃ！
The wind is crazy! The wind is crazy! The wind... the wind is crazy...!

820
00:42:19,864 --> 00:42:21,064
あ！ メラっち！
Ah! Melacchi!

821
00:42:21,064 --> 00:42:22,064
はい！
Yes!

822
00:42:22,064 --> 00:42:24,064
メラっち、これ見つけてきた！
Melacchi, I found this for you!

823
00:42:24,064 --> 00:42:25,864
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you so much!

824
00:42:26,064 --> 00:42:28,064
ハイー！ レッツゴー！
Alright! Let's go!

825
00:42:28,064 --> 00:42:30,064
Thank you のじゃ！
Thank you...!

826
00:42:30,064 --> 00:42:33,564
Be careful, be careful! Explosion, explosion!

827
00:42:33,564 --> 00:42:35,064
Be careful!

828
00:42:35,064 --> 00:42:36,564
Walk slowly, walk...

829
00:42:36,564 --> 00:42:39,564
なに？ What? What のじゃ！？
What? What? What...!?

830
00:42:39,564 --> 00:42:41,564
Melacchi!

831
00:42:41,564 --> 00:42:44,064
Sit down! The bug hit her! No!

832
00:42:44,064 --> 00:42:47,564
Bug? Bug hit me?

833
00:42:47,564 --> 00:42:50,064
Because it was working...

834
00:42:50,064 --> 00:42:53,064
I'm... I'm alive, but I'm...

835
00:42:53,564 --> 00:42:56,064
一番下じゃの...
I'm at the very bottom...

836
00:42:56,064 --> 00:42:57,564
How...

837
00:42:57,564 --> 00:42:59,064
Yes!

838
00:42:59,064 --> 00:43:03,064
I'm here, but how can I go there?

839
00:43:03,564 --> 00:43:06,564
どうしょうかにゃ。ご飯食べるか。
What should I do? Should I eat food?

840
00:43:07,564 --> 00:43:09,564
一番下なのじゃ！
I'm at the very bottom...!

841
00:43:09,564 --> 00:43:11,564
メラっち！
Melacchi!

842
00:43:12,064 --> 00:43:16,064
Yes! どうしょうかにゃ。やばい。
Yes! What should I do? This is bad.

843
00:43:16,064 --> 00:43:20,064
I'll try to grab... I'll try to go grab her...

844
00:43:21,564 --> 00:43:25,564
How... how can we go there?

845
00:43:26,064 --> 00:43:27,564
やばい！ 風が！
Bad! The wind is...!

846
00:43:27,564 --> 00:43:31,064
え、ジェットパック？ ジェットパック！ ジェットパック使っていい？
Huh, a jetpack? A jetpack! Can I use the jetpack?

847
00:43:31,064 --> 00:43:32,864
Can I use jetpack?
Can I use the jetpack?

848
00:43:32,864 --> 00:43:34,564
あ、あるよ。
Ah, you have it.

849
00:43:35,064 --> 00:43:37,064
But どこにいるかわかんない。
But I don't know where you guys are.

850
00:43:38,064 --> 00:43:40,064
使ってみるのじゃ。
I'll try using it...!

851
00:43:40,064 --> 00:43:41,564
使ってみて。
Give it a try.

852
00:43:41,564 --> 00:43:42,564
Okay.

853
00:43:42,564 --> 00:43:44,564
How can use it?
How can I use it?

854
00:43:45,064 --> 00:43:48,064
えっと多分、スペース長押し？
Umm, probably hold down Space?

855
00:43:48,064 --> 00:43:49,864
スペース長押し。
Hold down Space.

856
00:43:50,064 --> 00:43:53,064
ジャンプしてスペース長押し。
Jump and hold Space.

857
00:43:55,864 --> 00:43:57,864
何の声？
What voice is that?

858
00:43:58,064 --> 00:44:00,064
What is this?

859
00:44:01,064 --> 00:44:03,064
I hear man!
I hear a man!

860
00:44:03,064 --> 00:44:06,064
Yes, I hear man voice! What is that?
Yes, I hear a man's voice! What is that?

861
00:44:08,864 --> 00:44:10,564
火つけなきゃいけないの？
Do we have to light a fire?

862
00:44:12,064 --> 00:44:13,264
How can...

863
00:44:13,264 --> 00:44:14,564
I hear man!
I hear a man!

864
00:44:16,064 --> 00:44:20,064
Where is... Where's fire? どこに火あるの？
Where is... Where's fire? Where is the fire?

865
00:44:21,064 --> 00:44:23,064
単体じゃ使えないかもしれないこれ。
Maybe we can't use this on its own.

866
00:44:23,064 --> 00:44:25,064
あ、単体じゃ使えない！ なるほど。
Ah, it can't be used on its own! I see.

867
00:44:25,564 --> 00:44:27,564
私使ったことないんだよねそれ、実は。
I've actually never used that before.

868
00:44:27,564 --> 00:44:28,864
なるほど。
I see.

869
00:44:28,864 --> 00:44:30,864
あ、こっちから無理そう。
Ah, looks like I can't go from here.

870
00:44:31,564 --> 00:44:34,064
あ！ キョーコいる！
Ah! Kyoko is there!

871
00:44:34,064 --> 00:44:35,364
あ、来たよ！
Ah, here I come!

872
00:44:35,364 --> 00:44:37,264
キョーコ Thank you のじゃ！
Kyoko, thank you...!

873
00:44:37,564 --> 00:44:40,064
ちょっと待ってね。なんかねラゲッジとかあったら...
Wait a second. If there's luggage or something...

874
00:44:40,064 --> 00:44:40,864
うん。
Yeah.

875
00:44:41,064 --> 00:44:45,064
もっと見つけたいんだけど、ないかさすがに。私もね、お腹がやばい。
I want to find more, but maybe there aren't any. I'm also really hungry.

876
00:44:45,064 --> 00:44:49,064
お腹... ああ！ 私食べなきゃよかった！ あげればよかったのじゃ！
Hungry... Ah! I shouldn't have eaten! I should have given it to you...!

877
00:44:49,064 --> 00:44:53,064
あ、大丈夫！ 多分ね、この辺見つかると思うから、選ばなければ。ほら！
Ah, it's fine! I think we can find some around here if we aren't picky. Look!

878
00:44:53,064 --> 00:44:56,264
このイエローシュルームベリーあるじゃん。とりあえず食うわ。
There's this yellow shroomberry here. I'll eat it for now.

879
00:44:56,264 --> 00:44:57,264
のじゃ！
...!

880
00:44:58,064 --> 00:45:00,064
えっとね... 毒です！
Um... It's poison!

881
00:45:01,029 --> 00:45:03,015
間に合え！間に合え！
Make it in time! Make it in time!

882
00:45:03,272 --> 00:45:05,172
向こうにもなんか... あ、あそこになんか！
There's something over there too... Ah, there's something over there!

883
00:45:05,861 --> 00:45:07,529
一瞬無敵になった、今！
I became invincible for a second just now!

884
00:45:08,276 --> 00:45:09,756
あれ何？
What's that?

885
00:45:09,991 --> 00:45:11,273
行ける？大丈夫？
Can you make it? Are you okay?

886
00:45:10,669 --> 00:45:11,962
あれもマッシュルーム。
That's a mushroom too.

887
00:45:11,962 --> 00:45:13,416
キョーコにごはんあげたい。
I want to give Kyoko some food.

888
00:45:14,470 --> 00:45:15,621
あ、大丈夫だよ。
Ah, I'm okay.

889
00:45:15,427 --> 00:45:18,139
てか、ここ登れそうだな。うん、ここ登れそう。
Actually, it looks like we can climb up here. Yeah, we can climb up here.

890
00:45:18,139 --> 00:45:19,995
オッケー。センキュー。
Okay. Thank you.

891
00:45:20,802 --> 00:45:23,772
ここ行って、ここ行って...
Go here, then go here...

892
00:45:24,861 --> 00:45:26,774
で、次ここかな？行けるかな？
And next is here maybe? Can we make it?

893
00:45:25,869 --> 00:45:27,207
行くのじゃ。
Let me go.

894
00:45:27,207 --> 00:45:31,331
よいしょ。よいしょ。よいしょ。よいしょ。
Heave-ho. Heave-ho. Heave-ho. Heave-ho.

895
00:45:31,331 --> 00:45:34,993
で、たぶん... あ、まずい！風！
And probably... Ah, oh no! Wind!

896
00:45:34,993 --> 00:45:37,441
ここで待機なのじゃ。
Waiting here, noja.

897
00:45:35,872 --> 00:45:37,072
一回隠れて...
Hide for a second...

898
00:45:41,742 --> 00:45:46,403
たぶんここだったらね、そんなにスタミナなくても登れると思うから、このルートだったら。
If we go through here, I think we can climb even without that much stamina, taking this route.

899
00:45:45,403 --> 00:45:47,403
うん。ありがとうなのじゃ。
Yeah. Thank you, noja.

900
00:45:46,976 --> 00:45:48,002
これで行こうか。
Shall we go with this?

901
00:45:48,139 --> 00:45:49,143
いいよ。
Okay.

902
00:45:49,954 --> 00:45:53,721
よいしょ。よいしょ。よいしょ。
Heave-ho. Heave-ho. Heave-ho.

903
00:45:53,721 --> 00:45:58,333
こういうね、緑色のところは、手を離せば意外と休めるところ多いから、見た目いけなさそうでも。
In green places like this, if you let go of your hands, there are actually a lot of spots to rest, even if it doesn't look like it.

904
00:45:58,012 --> 00:45:59,112
分かった。
Got it.

905
00:46:00,026 --> 00:46:00,939
分かった。
Got it.

906
00:46:04,358 --> 00:46:05,820
行けそうだね、全然。
Looks like we can easily make it.

907
00:46:05,588 --> 00:46:07,483
行けそうなのじゃ。ありがとなのじゃ。
Looks like I can make it, noja. Thank you, noja.

908
00:46:08,643 --> 00:46:10,124
まだ間に合うから。
We can still make it in time.

909
00:46:11,042 --> 00:46:13,136
助けてくれたのじゃ。
You saved me, noja.

910
00:46:16,347 --> 00:46:18,222
あ、これ私の横取りだ。
Ah, this is mine that I snatched.

911
00:46:20,242 --> 00:46:22,572
あ、待って！ラゲッジある！
Ah, wait! There's luggage!

912
00:46:23,183 --> 00:46:25,662
開けてないラゲッジ。
Unopened luggage.

913
00:46:26,227 --> 00:46:28,212
えーっと、スポドリあるから飲んどいて。
Um, there's a sports drink, so drink up.

914
00:46:29,286 --> 00:46:30,479
スポドリ強いよ。
Sports drinks are really good.

915
00:46:35,165 --> 00:46:36,543
キョーコ、飲んだのじゃ。
Kyoko, I drank it, noja.

916
00:46:36,543 --> 00:46:40,907
あーんしてる！あーんしてる！あーんしてる！
You're making an "ahhh" face! You're making an "ahhh" face! You're making an "ahhh" face!

917
00:46:41,872 --> 00:46:43,672
Are you fine, Kyoko, Mela?

918
00:46:43,672 --> 00:46:46,072
Yes, I'm fine. Thank you!

919
00:46:47,852 --> 00:46:49,991
We're coming back! Don't worry!

920
00:46:50,922 --> 00:46:52,408
カミングバックなのじゃ。
Coming back, noja.

921
00:46:55,866 --> 00:46:58,814
このね、マッシュルームね、トランポリンなのよ。
This mushroom here is a trampoline.

922
00:46:58,402 --> 00:47:00,744
へえ、ジャンプで行けるの？
Oh, can we go with a jump?

923
00:47:01,290 --> 00:47:03,562
乗るとボヨンボヨンするのよ、こうやって。
If you get on it, it bounces like this.

924
00:47:03,562 --> 00:47:05,181
わしもボヨンボヨンしたい。
I want to bounce bounce too.

925
00:47:07,801 --> 00:47:11,272
これ上毒の植物あるから気をつけて。
Watch out, there are poisonous plants up above.

926
00:47:10,872 --> 00:47:12,072
やば。
Oh crap.

927
00:47:14,436 --> 00:47:17,409
あ、ちょっと待って！ここにパープルマッシュルームあるから食うわ！やべ！
Ah, wait a sec! There's a purple mushroom here, so I'll eat it! Oh crap!

928
00:47:17,544 --> 00:47:19,539
Go, go, go, go!

929
00:47:19,539 --> 00:47:22,014
マジ風、風、風！
Seriously, wind, wind, wind!

930
00:47:22,014 --> 00:47:23,152
あいたーい！
Ouch!

931
00:47:23,152 --> 00:47:25,367
何が起きた？何が起きた？
What happened? What happened?

932
00:47:25,367 --> 00:47:26,183
大丈夫？
Are you okay?

933
00:47:26,183 --> 00:47:29,423
風で... 風でなんか踏んだ、今。
Because of the wind... I stepped on something just now due to the wind.

934
00:47:29,423 --> 00:47:30,392
なるほど。
I see.

935
00:47:32,482 --> 00:47:34,403
助けて！
Help!

936
00:47:34,403 --> 00:47:35,412
キョーコ！
Kyoko!

937
00:47:36,640 --> 00:47:38,907
怖い音する。
It makes a scary sound.

938
00:47:39,992 --> 00:47:41,112
キョーコどこ？
Where's Kyoko?

939
00:47:42,992 --> 00:47:43,972
何の音？
What's that sound?

940
00:47:48,402 --> 00:47:49,272
キョーコどこ？
Where's Kyoko?

941
00:47:49,272 --> 00:47:51,712
何？何？何？何？
What? What? What? What?

942
00:47:54,012 --> 00:47:55,772
誰？誰？
Who? Who?

943
00:47:56,912 --> 00:47:59,072
誰の... 何？わし... のじゃ。
Whose... what? I... noja.

944
00:48:00,672 --> 00:48:04,352
助けて！カブトムシに追われてます！助けてください！
Help! I'm being chased by a beetle! Please help me!

945
00:48:04,352 --> 00:48:06,072
カブトムシに...
By a beetle...

946
00:48:06,912 --> 00:48:11,032
逃げる、逃げる、逃げる、逃げる。
Run, run, run, run.

947
00:48:11,422 --> 00:48:12,852
何の声？
Whose voice is that?

948
00:48:12,852 --> 00:48:14,672
I found it!

949
00:48:17,772 --> 00:48:19,272
降りたらカブトムシにやられる...
If I climb down, the beetle will get me...

950
00:48:24,772 --> 00:48:26,572
Here! I can see you guys!

951
00:48:26,572 --> 00:48:28,072
Mela, come here! Mela, come here!

952
00:48:28,372 --> 00:48:32,472
何？何？痛い痛い痛い！
What? What? Ouch ouch ouch!

953
00:48:32,472 --> 00:48:35,372
Mela, こっち来て！Mela, こっち来て！
Mela, come here! Mela, come here!

954
00:48:35,372 --> 00:48:36,872
Mela, こっち来て！はい。
"Mela, come here!" Okay.

955
00:48:37,072 --> 00:48:39,172
これ！
This!

956
00:48:39,672 --> 00:48:41,572
Ow! Ow!

957
00:48:44,272 --> 00:48:47,372
あ、キョーコ！キョーコ、大丈夫？
Ah, Kyoko! Kyoko, are you okay?

958
00:48:48,072 --> 00:48:49,072
I died!

959
00:48:49,072 --> 00:48:52,072
Your items... Your items are on the floor.

960
00:48:53,072 --> 00:48:55,272
Get everything!

961
00:48:55,272 --> 00:48:57,072
Are you still there, Mela?

962
00:48:56,572 --> 00:48:57,872
Yes! Yes!

963
00:48:57,872 --> 00:49:00,672
わし見えない。今...
I can't see. Right now...

964
00:49:00,072 --> 00:49:01,372
Wait, wait, wait, here, here.

965
00:49:01,372 --> 00:49:04,572
キノコになってる。ほにょ？
I've turned into a mushroom. Huh?

966
00:49:05,172 --> 00:49:08,572
What? What? 何？何？
What? What? What? What?

967
00:49:14,872 --> 00:49:17,372
What? What happened?

968
00:49:16,872 --> 00:49:18,572
何が起きてる？
What is happening?

969
00:49:19,472 --> 00:49:24,072
I'll be mushroom! My... 体力ゲージが全部キノコになってる！
I'll be mushroom! My... health gauge has turned completely into mushrooms!

970
00:49:25,572 --> 00:49:28,072
I'm mushroom now!

971
00:49:29,072 --> 00:49:30,072
What?

972
00:49:31,072 --> 00:49:33,572
What? You're mushroom now?!

973
00:49:33,572 --> 00:49:35,572
Yes, I'm mushroom now!

974
00:49:35,572 --> 00:49:37,072
I think she can heal from that.

975
00:49:37,572 --> 00:49:40,072
Ho? Really? のじゃ？ What? Ah!
Huh? Really, noja? What? Ah!

976
00:49:40,572 --> 00:49:42,572
食べたら回復するぞ、それ。
If you eat, that'll heal you.

977
00:49:42,272 --> 00:49:44,072
回復した！
It healed me!

978
00:49:44,072 --> 00:49:46,072
Yes, I'm good now. Thank you!

979
00:49:46,072 --> 00:49:48,572
Let's go!

980
00:49:48,872 --> 00:49:50,872
I think we need to hurry though.

981
00:49:50,272 --> 00:49:53,672
Kaela is here! Kaela is here!

982
00:49:54,072 --> 00:49:55,272
Okay, okay. Go, go, go!

983
00:49:55,272 --> 00:49:57,272
Wasn't the way... I don't think. Maybe here.

984
00:49:57,572 --> 00:50:00,072
Are you sure? Because we have...

985
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:02,580
Rope cannon! The blue thing is there.

986
00:50:03,080 --> 00:50:04,280
よいしょ
Yoisho.

987
00:50:04,480 --> 00:50:06,880
I got the rope cannon too by the way. I have rope cannon...

988
00:50:06,880 --> 00:50:08,880
Yeah, we see... we see the blue thing.

989
00:50:09,080 --> 00:50:11,280
But it's okay, maybe we can go up from here.

990
00:50:11,380 --> 00:50:13,280
さっきの男性の声、あれかな？
Was that male voice earlier maybe...?

991
00:50:13,280 --> 00:50:15,580
That blue thing is the healing one.

992
00:50:15,580 --> 00:50:16,880
マンドラゴラ？
A mandrake?

993
00:50:16,480 --> 00:50:17,380
Yeah.

994
00:50:17,380 --> 00:50:18,480
I would love it.

995
00:50:18,080 --> 00:50:19,080
Yeah, we need that.

996
00:50:18,880 --> 00:50:19,780
Thank you!

997
00:50:19,780 --> 00:50:22,080
The healing thing is too good to ignore.

998
00:50:22,080 --> 00:50:23,080
Yes, yes!

999
00:50:23,080 --> 00:50:24,080
よいしょ
Yoisho.

1000
00:50:24,080 --> 00:50:26,280
Wait a minute, I don't have enough stamina for that.

1001
00:50:26,280 --> 00:50:27,280
Okay.

1002
00:50:27,580 --> 00:50:29,880
There's... there's a way around, I think.

1003
00:50:30,080 --> 00:50:32,080
Like around this over here...

1004
00:50:30,080 --> 00:50:33,880
よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ
Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho.

1005
00:50:33,580 --> 00:50:35,080
...maybe.

1006
00:50:35,280 --> 00:50:36,580
I couldn't get up there.

1007
00:50:36,280 --> 00:50:37,580
We can go this...

1008
00:50:37,880 --> 00:50:38,880
Oh no!

1009
00:50:39,080 --> 00:50:41,580
Can you... can you go up?

1010
00:50:41,580 --> 00:50:42,580
Up? No?

1011
00:50:42,580 --> 00:50:44,280
Oh yeah, there could be a way around. Maybe not, yeah.

1012
00:50:45,080 --> 00:50:46,080
よいしょ
